- [ ] Generate C# mod project targeting `GtaAnything.Runtime`:
  ```bash
  gta-anything --json transpile gameplay_ir.json -o build/{{MOD_ID}}
  ```
- [ ] Verify generated artifacts:
  - [ ] `{{MOD_CLASS_NAME}}.csproj` (with `GTAV_ENHANCED` / `GTAV_LEGACY` conditional compilation)
  - [ ] `ModEntrypoint.cs` (using `WorldSession`, `OperationalStateMachine`, `SafeModelStreamer`, `DecoupledMenuController`, `PhasedJsonLogger`)
  - [ ] `{{MOD_CLASS_NAME}}Config.json`
  - [ ] `BUILD_AND_VERIFY.md`

