## Phase 4: 5-Stage Gen8/Gen9 Asset Verification Gate (`gta-anything asset-check`)

- [ ] Run static binary & DLC registration checks (Gate 1 & Gate 2):
  ```bash
  gta-anything --json asset-check build/{{MOD_ID}} --edition {{PRIMARY_EDITION}}
  ```
- [ ] Verify all 5 Asset Gates:
  - [ ] **Gate 1 (Static Binary Audit)**: Gen9 `.yft` version == `171`, `.ytd` version == `5`; all `script_rt_*` dashboard textures use single-mip (`mip=1`) `B8G8R8A8_UNORM` (zero legacy `DXT1`).
  - [ ] **Gate 2 (DLC Registration)**: `dlclist.xml` is well-formed XML and registers `dlcpacks:/<addon_name>/` inside isolated `mods/` copy.
  - [ ] **Gate 3 (Engine Model Streaming)**: `SafeModelStreamer` enforces timeout (`stream_timeout_ms`), calls `MarkAsNoLongerNeeded()` on timeout, and falls back to `vanilla_fallback_model`.
  - [ ] **Gate 4 (World Entity Spawning)**: `CreateVehicle` / `CreatePed` return handle verified non-null and `Exists() == true` before property access.
  - [ ] **Gate 5 (Operational Interaction)**: Driver seating, door control, NPC boarding/interaction, and fare/reward accounting complete without stall.

